TI  - Influence of Medium Properties on the Inactivation Effect of Polyphenol Oxidase and Peroxidase of Mango by Ultrasound
ST  - 介质特性对超声波钝化芒果多酚氧化酶和过氧化物酶的影响
PY  - 2020
