TI  - Optimization of electrodialysis with bipolar membranes applied to cloudy apple juice: Minimization of malic acid and sugar losses
PY  - 2011
T2  - Innovative Food Science and Emerging Technologies
VL  - 12
IS  - 1
SP  - 45
EP  - 49
DO  - 10.1016/j.ifset.2010.12.007
