TI  - Effects of sugars and sugar alcohols on the gelatinization temperature of wheat starch
PY  - 2018
T2  - Food Hydrocolloids
VL  - 84
SP  - 593
EP  - 607
DO  - 10.1016/j.foodhyd.2018.06.035
