TI  - Efficacy of plant-based natural preservatives in extending shelf life of sugarcane juice: Formulation optimization by MOGA and correlation study by principal component analysis
PY  - 2022
T2  - Applied Food Research
VL  - 2
IS  - 2
C7  - 100164
