TI  - Non-destructive estimation of mandarin orange fruit quality during the ripening stage using machine-learning-based spectroscopic techniques
PY  - 2025
T2  - Journal of Food Measurement and Characterization
VL  - 19
IS  - 2
SP  - 862
EP  - 875
DO  - 10.1007/s11694-024-02999-5
