TI  - Biofuel cell controlled by enzyme logic network - Approaching physiologically regulated devices
PY  - 2009
T2  - Bioelectrochemistry
VL  - 76
IS  - 1-2
SP  - 4
EP  - 9
DO  - 10.1016/j.bioelechem.2009.03.008
