TI  - Estimating sugarcane yield and its components using unoccupied aerial systems (UAS)-based high throughput phenotyping (HTP)
T2  - COMPUTERS AND ELECTRONICS IN AGRICULTURE
LA  - English
KW  - Yield prediction
KW  - Machine learning
