TI  - Can robots "Taste" grapes? Estimating SSC with simple RGB sensors☆
T2  - COMPUTERS AND ELECTRONICS IN AGRICULTURE
LA  - English
KW  - Precision agriculture
KW  - SSC estimation
KW  - Computer vision
KW  - Robotics
