TI  - On tree nutrients spray and bagging influenced the quality and postharvest physiology of mango (cv. Amrapali) at ambient storage
T2  - PLANT PHYSIOLOGY REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - Amrapali mango
KW  - CaCl2
KW  - K2SO4
